# ── Privacy (PLAN.md §0 — HARD RULE) ─────────────────────────────
# Real lodge data (names, phones, emails) must never reach git history.
Examples/
wiki/
raw/
graphify-out/

# The address book is real personal data (PLAN.md §0 rule 5, M12). It lives in %AppData%, which
# cannot be committed — but "Save as a spreadsheet…" writes wherever the user browses to, and that
# can be this folder. Roster fixtures are fictional and live only in tests/Roster.Tests, which is
# why those names are excluded below rather than swept up here.
roster*.json
roster*.xlsx
*.roster.bak.json
!tests/Roster.Tests/Fixtures/**

# The personal spelling dictionary is real personal data too (PLAN.md §0 rule 7, M52). "It's a
# name — never ask again" is how most of the checker's questions get answered, so within a month
# this file is a list of the lodge's surnames. It lives in %AppData%, but it is a plain text file
# somebody may well copy somewhere to look at, and the successor pack (M64) writes one too.
personal-dictionary*.txt
*.tbpack

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
publish/
*.binlog

# ── IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
.nightshift/

# ── Test / tooling output ────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
coverage/
*.received.png
*.actual.png

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Font build tooling (M14) — the venv and the upstream download cache are local aids.
assets-src/fonts/tools/.venv/
assets-src/fonts/tools/.cache/
